{"server":"cn","storyId":"act12d0_level_act12d0_04_end","groupId":"act12d0","stageId":"act12d0_04","title":"机兽咆哮","storyCode":"RI-4","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act12d0/level_act12d0_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"37365c07d416c7e364ddfc0a19c429ed479b8632ee094f6e65726497929221f3","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯喽喽A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘎哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯喽喽B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太、太强了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乌代","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"算你厉害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿鲁纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"森蚺，别得意！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿鲁纳","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"小的们，上！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不愧是祖玛玛，果然很厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然只有一个人，一般的阿达克利斯也不是她的对手，就像嘉维尔一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你好像很熟悉她。","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，祖玛玛和嘉维尔从前开始就是我们这一带最厉害的两个人呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"不过据我所知，祖玛玛从来没有赢过嘉维尔哦！"}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"博士。在外面这么厉害的人一定很少见吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，嘉维尔更厉害哦！"}]},{"label":"好帅的女孩子。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，虽然祖玛玛确实很帅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，嘉维尔更帅！"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"对吧，嘉维尔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，嘉维尔呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人A","speakerId":"avg_npc_071","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们看，那个人是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人B","speakerId":"avg_npc_070","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才在来的路上就看到了，她是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿达克利斯人C","speakerId":"avg_npc_072","isRemote":false,"text":"她居然真的回来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你是——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"所有人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嘉维尔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"哇啊啊啊啊，嘉维尔直接冲上台了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"好久不见啊，祖玛玛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"现在应该叫你森蚺头领了对吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你居然回来了，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，特米米叫我回来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？等等，你居然也会说萨尔贡语？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然你也会这种语言，看来这种语言确实是外面的语言没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我学习了很久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......我以为你不会再回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"我会回来的，不是现在，未来也会回来的，这里是我的家。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要当大酋长？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"不，本来我只是找你有点事，打完再找你也没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你这家伙变得这么厉害了，这让我怎么忍得住啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的去做医生了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，我在外面可是很有名的医生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"真意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你呢，上次的时候你不是在捣鼓自己的东西没有参加吗？终于捣鼓好了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你马上就会见到。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜呜，嘉维尔不是说她不会出手的吗......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"嘉维尔出乎你的意料了？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"诶？没、没有的事！只、只是......."}]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"博士也看入迷了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，虽然确实很帅，但是......"}]},{"label":"这才是嘉维尔。","value":"3","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特米米","speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜，虽然这么说是没错。"}]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......你还是那么强，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，你也不差啊，祖玛玛！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，你太依赖你的拳头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你的拳头让你可以做到许多事，所以你从不考虑用拳头以外的东西做事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"这是你的局限性，也是我们这些人的局限性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"你到底在说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"我在说，该改变了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着“嘿咻”，“嘿咻”整齐的号子声，林间似乎有什么庞然大物在靠近神庙。\n它缓慢，而又坚实地“走”着，还不见其全貌，就已经让人感觉它无坚不摧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你确实很强，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"原本，我是想在成为大酋长后再用它的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，我不得不用它来对付你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，结果是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"它将改变这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道你在说什么，不过我可没那么轻易倒下啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"不，你会轻易地倒下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"......大祭司，瞄准，开炮！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"ac12_4"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"嘉维尔","speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，那是？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_temple_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，我说了，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，用它对付你，并不是我本来的目的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"靠拳头是没有未来的，嘉维尔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"森蚺","speakerId":"char_416_zumama","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，是机器的时代。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_187_ccheal","aliases":["嘉维尔"]},{"speakerId":"char_411_tomimi","aliases":["特米米"]},{"speakerId":"char_416_zumama","aliases":["森蚺"]}]}
